        rdfs:comment                   "Panel of silk damask embroidered with silk and gold thread, Japan, 18th century"@en , "Panel of blue silk damask with a fret pattern and scattered flower motifs, embroidered in orange, yellow, green and white silk and gold thread with precious things (takara), a flaming pearl, a lozenge, scrolls and plants. \n\nThe piece is joined down the centre."@en ;
